Cell["\<\
Every supplied displacement contributes explicitly; reverse hoppings are not \
generated automatically.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1991726884,ExpressionUUID->"d09e1306-6811-1749-b721-39722b48e5f7"],

Cell["\<\
Supply both positive and negative displacements when both are needed.\
\>", "Notes",
